+# CONTRACT — Reactive Spreadsheet Engine
+
+Definition of done. Every box must pass via `npm test`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`.
+
+## Cell references & columns
+- [ ] `A1` parses to column 1, row 1 → unit test on cellRef helpers
+- [ ] Multi-letter columns: `Z`=26, `AA`=27, `AZ`=52, `BA`=53 → unit test colToNum/numToCol round-trip
+- [ ] Cell keys normalized to uppercase: `set('a1',5)` then `get('A1')` === 5
+- [ ] Invalid cell ref (`'foo'`, `'1A'`, `'A0'`, `''`) throws on set/get → test toThrow
+
+## Raw values
+- [ ] Numbers stored & returned: `set('A1',42)` → `get('A1')` === 42
+- [ ] Floats: `set('A1',3.14)` → 3.14
+- [ ] Strings: `set('A1','hello')` → 'hello'
+- [ ] Booleans: `set('A1',true)` → true
+- [ ] Unset cell: `get('Z9')` === null
+- [ ] `getDisplay` of unset cell === ''
+- [ ] `getDisplay(number)` === String(n); `getDisplay(bool)` === 'true'/'false'; `getDisplay(string)` === string
+
+## Arithmetic formulas
+- [ ] `=A1+A2` sums (10+20=30) → get===30
+- [ ] `=A1-A2`, `=A1*A2`, `=A1/A2` work
+- [ ] Operator precedence: `=2+3*4` === 14
+- [ ] Parentheses: `=(A1+B1)*2` groups correctly
+- [ ] Unary minus: `=-A1`, `=3*-2` === -6
+- [ ] Numeric literals & decimals in formulas: `=3.5+1.5` === 5
+- [ ] Division by zero → error value '#DIV/0!'
+- [ ] Reference to empty cell in arithmetic treated as 0: `=A1+1` with A1 empty === 1
+- [ ] Booleans coerce in arithmetic: TRUE=1 (`=A1+1` with A1=true === 2)
+- [ ] String operand in arithmetic → '#VALUE!'
+
+## Functions (ranges)
+- [ ] `SUM(A1:A5)` sums numerics, ignores empty/strings
+- [ ] `SUM(A1:C1)` row range
+- [ ] `SUM(A1:C3)` block range (all 9 cells)
+- [ ] `AVERAGE(range)` mean of numerics; empty range → '#DIV/0!'
+- [ ] `MIN(range)`, `MAX(range)` over numerics
+- [ ] `COUNT(range)` counts numerics only (ignores strings/bools/empty)
+- [ ] Functions accept multiple args / scalars: `SUM(A1,A2,5)`
+- [ ] Unknown function → '#NAME?'
+
+## IF & comparisons
+- [ ] `=IF(A1>30,"big","small")` returns branch by condition
+- [ ] All comparison ops: `>`,`<`,`>=`,`<=`,`=`,`<>`
+- [ ] Comparisons return booleans; string comparison works (`="a"="a"` → true)
+- [ ] IF only evaluates chosen branch is not required, but result correct
+
+## Reactive updates
+- [ ] Changing A1 updates dependent A3 (`=A1+A2`) automatically
+- [ ] Transitive: A1→B1(`=A1+1`)→C1(`=B1+1`); change A1 cascades to C1
+- [ ] Changing a cell to a literal removes its formula dependencies (no stale recompute)
+- [ ] Multiple dependents all update
+- [ ] Range dependents update when a cell inside range changes
+
+## Circular references
+- [ ] Direct: A1=`=B1`, B1=`=A1` → second set throws
+- [ ] Self: A1=`=A1+1` → throws
+- [ ] Indirect through chain A1→B1→C1→A1 → throws
+- [ ] Failed (throwing) set does NOT corrupt state: prior value preserved
+- [ ] Setting a cell that references a range including itself throws
+
+## getCells
+- [ ] Returns Map of all non-empty cells → computed values
+- [ ] Excludes unset cells
+- [ ] Reflects reactive updates
+
+## Quality gates
+- [ ] `npm test` all pass
+- [ ] `npm run build` clean (tsc)
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean (eslint)
